{"name":"Mine Shaft","hex":"#373e41","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"mine shaft","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative form of mineshaft."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/mine_shaft"}],"entries":[{"title":"Shaft sinking","blocks":[{"text":"Shaft mining or shaft sinking is the action of excavating a mine shaft from the top down, where there is initially no access to the bottom. Shallow shafts, typically sunk for civil engineering projects, differ greatly in execution method from deep shafts, typically sunk for mining projects."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dc/Auguste_Victoria_mine_shafts%2C_Marl.jpg/330px-Auguste_Victoria_mine_shafts%2C_Marl.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shaft_sinking","wikidata":"Q334493"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Mine_shaft_plan_cross_section.png/500px-Mine_shaft_plan_cross_section.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Mine_shaft_plan_cross_section.png/500px-Mine_shaft_plan_cross_section.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A plan-view schematic of a mine shaft showing cage and skip compartments. Services may be housed in either of the four open compartments.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMine_shaft_plan_cross_section.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Muzeum_%C5%9Al%C4%85skie_-_szyb_Warszawa_II_03.jpg/500px-Muzeum_%C5%9Al%C4%85skie_-_szyb_Warszawa_II_03.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Muzeum_%C5%9Al%C4%85skie_-_szyb_Warszawa_II_03.jpg/1280px-Muzeum_%C5%9Al%C4%85skie_-_szyb_Warszawa_II_03.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org